{1 tiny_libs }

The libraries under the {{:../elm_playground/index.html} Elm Playground},
written from scratch for teaching: one idea per module, each interface
with its diagram, its worked example and its references. None of them
knows the Playground: a module here speaks pixels, samples, bodies,
bytes or rectangles, never shapes.

Each is a library of its own, named [tiny_libs.<name>] outside this
repository, for example in a dune file:

{v
(executable
 (name main)
 (libraries tiny_libs.crypto tiny_libs.graphics_png))
v}

The libraries are unwrapped: their modules are used by their own names,
[Sha256.digest], [Png.decode].

{2:core Core}

[tiny_libs.core]: a small part of Elm's core, and a calendar.

{!modules: Basics Color Set_ Keyboard Time Cmd Sub Program Base64 Civil Clock Julian Recur}

[tiny_libs.random]: the seeded generator, the same numbers natively and
in a browser.

{!modules: Lehmer}

{2:crypto Cryptography}

[tiny_libs.crypto]: SHA-1, and what TLS 1.3 needs.

{!modules:
    Sha1 Sha256 Sha512 Hmac Hkdf Chacha20 Poly1305 Chacha20_poly1305
    Aes Gcm Bignum X25519 Ecdsa Rsa
}

{2:compression Compression}

[tiny_libs.compression]: what the image, video and audio formats share.

{!modules: Huffman Inflate Deflate Zlib Crc32 Adler32 Lzw Packbits Bits Vlc}

{2:graphics Graphics}

The core ([tiny_libs.graphics_core]) and 2D geometry
([tiny_libs.graphics_2d_geometry]):

{!modules: Framebuffer Blit Matting Opti Pixelate Vec2 Affine Curve}

The 2D rasterizer ([tiny_libs.graphics_2d]) and the fonts
([tiny_libs.graphics_font]):

{!modules: Fill Line Circle Stroke Magnifier Hershey Vga_font}

The 3D rasterizer ([tiny_libs.graphics_3d]) and the geometry all 3D
renderers share ([tiny_libs.graphics_3d_geometry]):

{!modules:
    Project Clip Cull Triangle Interpolate Zbuffer Painter Shading
    Texture Render
    Vec3 Mat4 Camera Lighting Ray Material
}

The ray tracer ([tiny_libs.graphics_raytrace]), and the GPU's retained
meshes ([tiny_libs.graphics_gpu]):

{!modules: Solid Transform Csg Bvh Raytrace Perlin Mesh_cache}

Image formats, a library each ([tiny_libs.graphics_rgba],
[tiny_libs.graphics_png], [tiny_libs.graphics_gif],
[tiny_libs.graphics_jpeg], [tiny_libs.graphics_xpm],
[tiny_libs.graphics_ilbm], [tiny_libs.graphics_svg]), and their loading,
native only ([tiny_libs.graphics_images]):

{!modules:
    Rgba_image Png Gif Dct Jpeg Jpeg_encode Xpm Ilbm Svg
    Download Image_decode Texture_decode
}

Image processing ([tiny_libs.graphics_imaging]):

{!modules:
    Lut Histogram Hsl Convolve Gaussian Sobel Median Add_noise Scale
    Mask Composite Brush Gradient Blend Layers Pixels
}

Video formats, a library each ([tiny_libs.graphics_movie],
[tiny_libs.graphics_yuv], [tiny_libs.graphics_y4m],
[tiny_libs.graphics_fli], [tiny_libs.graphics_avi],
[tiny_libs.graphics_mpeg1], [tiny_libs.graphics_mpeg_system]):

{!modules: Movie Yuv Psnr Y4m Fli Avi Mpeg1_vlc Mpeg1 Motion Mpeg1_encode Mpeg_system}

Animation, Core Animation's ideas ([tiny_libs.graphics_animation]):

{!modules: Timing Animation Transition}

