{2:ai Game AI}

Moving ([tiny_libs.ai_movement]), deciding ([tiny_libs.ai_decision]),
bots ([tiny_libs.ai_bots]), searching ([tiny_libs.ai_search]),
learning ([tiny_libs.ai_learning]); all five are [tiny_libs.ai]:

{!modules:
    Pathfind Steering Flock
    Fsm Behavior Utility
    Sense Bot
    Minimax Deepening Zobrist Mcts
    Matrix Neuron Net Backprop Grad Train Qlearn
}

{2:networking Networking}

The protocols as bytes in, bytes out ([tiny_libs.networking_protocols]),
mail ([tiny_libs.networking_mail]), the netcode of multiplayer games
([tiny_libs.networking_netcode]); all three are [tiny_libs.networking]:

{!modules:
    Url Urlencoded Http Websocket Irc Smtp Pop3 Wire Transport
    Mail Mime Mbox Mail_thread
    Checksum Sim_net Inputs Lockstep Rollback Snapshot Prediction
    Interpolation
}

TLS 1.3 ([tiny_libs.networking_tls]):

{!modules: Asn1 Pem X509 Tls13}

The sockets, native only ([tiny_libs.networking_unix]):

{!modules:
    Tcp Udp Worker Http_client Http_request Http_server Tls_client
    Tls_tunnel Server Relay Relay_client Universe_server Irc_server
    Mail_server Connect
}

